lly vulnerable moment, and frankly I don't think that was an accident.</spa=
n></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">As a result, I look=
