ways that made no operational or ethical sense whatsoever. This is why I do=
n't understand why you protect them
 - they are very clearly liabilities.</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_xmsonormal"><span style=3D"color:#212121">Allison covered it =
up for them. And you protected all of them. Your response to my open letter=
